{"seq":1,"slug":"alert-triage-case-management","title":"告警分诊与案件管理：队列分级、SLA 与调查工作台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/synthetic-identity-fraud-graph-detection/investigation-ops-compliance/alert-triage-case-management","wordCount":2755,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"告警分诊与案件管理-队列分级-sla-与调查工作台\">告警分诊与案件管理：队列分级、SLA 与调查工作台</h1><p>图模型把某个账号簇打成 0.91，这只在决策引擎里生成了一条待办；身份图谱指出这 14 个账号共用两枚设备指纹，这也只是一条边。把信号变成损失规避的是<strong>调查运营</strong>：谁先看这一条、手边有什么证据、写下哪个结案码、这个结案码如何回流成训练标签。上游的动作路由见 <a href=\"../graph-fraud-detection-ml/rules-scoring-decision-engine\">规则+模型评分决策引擎</a>，本篇只解决「动作=转人工」之后的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从告警洪流到可结案案件\">核心概念：从告警洪流到可结案案件</h2><p><strong>分诊</strong>回答「哪一条先看、看多快」——资源受限下的排序问题；<strong>案件管理</strong>回答「一条告警如何变成有结论、有证据、有审计痕迹的案件」——状态机加留痕问题。行业平台把二者合并成一个对象：Stripe Radar 的 Review 列表是需进一步查看的支付排队列表，并以 <code>review.opened</code> / <code>review.closed</code> 两个 webhook 事件标记进入与离开队列（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/radar/reviews\">Stripe Radar 审核文档</a>）；Sardine 的 Risk Case Management 把「告警、交易、实体、决策集中在一个集成视图」中，并提供自动分派、SLA 监控与结案质量抽检（<a href=\"https://www.sardine.ai/risk-case-management\">Sardine Risk Case Management</a>）。共同结构是：<strong>入库 → 分级 → 分派 → 调查 → 结案 → 回流</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  AL[告警生成&lt;br/&gt;规则/模型/图谱/外部核验] --&gt; IN[入库与去重&lt;br/&gt;同簇合并为 case]&#10;  IN --&gt; TRI{分诊分级&lt;br/&gt;代价 x 时效}&#10;  TRI --&gt; Q1[Q1 变现阶段&lt;br/&gt;分钟级]&#10;  TRI --&gt; Q2[Q2 风险账号&lt;br/&gt;小时级]&#10;  TRI --&gt; Q3[Q3 批量挖掘&lt;br/&gt;日级]&#10;  TRI --&gt; Q4[Q4 观察池]&#10;  Q1 --&gt; INV[调查工作台&lt;br/&gt;证据 + 图谱上下文]&#10;  Q2 --&gt; INV&#10;  Q3 --&gt; INV&#10;  INV --&gt; DEC{结案判定}&#10;  DEC --&gt; D1[确认欺诈&lt;br/&gt;拒绝/冻结/上报]&#10;  DEC --&gt; D2[确认正常&lt;br/&gt;放行 + 白名单]&#10;  DEC --&gt; D3[情报不足&lt;br/&gt;挂起并监控]&#10;  D1 --&gt; FB[标签回流]&#10;  D2 --&gt; FB&#10;  D3 --&gt; FB&#10;  FB --&gt; AL\">flowchart TD\n  AL[告警生成&lt;br/&gt;规则/模型/图谱/外部核验] --&gt; IN[入库与去重&lt;br/&gt;同簇合并为 case]\n  IN --&gt; TRI{分诊分级&lt;br/&gt;代价 x 时效}\n  TRI --&gt; Q1[Q1 变现阶段&lt;br/&gt;分钟级]\n  TRI --&gt; Q2[Q2 风险账号&lt;br/&gt;小时级]\n  TRI --&gt; Q3[Q3 批量挖掘&lt;br/&gt;日级]\n  TRI --&gt; Q4[Q4 观察池]\n  Q1 --&gt; INV[调查工作台&lt;br/&gt;证据 + 图谱上下文]\n  Q2 --&gt; INV\n  Q3 --&gt; INV\n  INV --&gt; DEC{结案判定}\n  DEC --&gt; D1[确认欺诈&lt;br/&gt;拒绝/冻结/上报]\n  DEC --&gt; D2[确认正常&lt;br/&gt;放行 + 白名单]\n  DEC --&gt; D3[情报不足&lt;br/&gt;挂起并监控]\n  D1 --&gt; FB[标签回流]\n  D2 --&gt; FB\n  D3 --&gt; FB\n  FB --&gt; AL</pre><p>这条状态机有三个反直觉点。<strong>入库必须合并</strong>：同一设备簇触发的 14 条告警若各自成案，复核员会做 13 次重复劳动且结案码互相矛盾——Stripe 的「相关支付」分区就是同一邮箱、IP 或卡号下的其他支付聚合（同上文档）。<strong>挂起是合法结案码</strong>，不是待办遗留；合成身份的观察期以月计（见 <a href=\"../synthetic-identity-taxonomy/attack-lifecycle-bustout\">攻击生命周期与 bust-out 剧本</a>），证据不足时正确动作是保留监控而非强行判定，但挂起必须回流成未来的重开触发。<strong>全部分级为最高等于没有分级</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"队列分级-按代价与时效切分工作池\">队列分级：按代价与时效切分工作池</h2><p>单一队列是分诊的头号反模式：所有案件共处一条队列并按到达时间排序时，最先被处理的永远是最早到的而非最该处理的。<strong>分级依据不是分数高低，而是「错误地延迟一小时要付多少钱」</strong>——变现窗口（bust-out 现金化通常发生在 24–72 小时内）、金额量级、以及对下游的影响（是否已发货）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>队列</th>\n<th>触发信号</th>\n<th>目标 MTTA</th>\n<th>目标 MTTR</th>\n<th>复核员权限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Q1 变现阶段</td>\n<td>提现/大额下单 + 簇 ≥5 账号</td>\n<td>15 分钟</td>\n<td>2 小时</td>\n<td>冻结结算、拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q2 风险账号</td>\n<td>高风险分档 + 首笔订单</td>\n<td>1 小时</td>\n<td>8 小时</td>\n<td>加摩擦、挂起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q3 批量挖掘</td>\n<td>设备/IP 簇扩张、指纹复用率高</td>\n<td>1 个工作日</td>\n<td>3 个工作日</td>\n<td>拉黑簇、批量结案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q4 观察池</td>\n<td>低分但命中弱信号</td>\n<td>无承诺</td>\n<td>5 个工作日</td>\n<td>仅记录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Q1 的 15 分钟由变现窗口反推：若窗口为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 小时，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≪</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{MTTA} + T_{MTTR} \\ll W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，否则模型上午 9 点标记、复核员下午 5 点才看，资金已在中午转出。</p>\n<p>第二层是<strong>容量自洽</strong>。设每期交易量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>、欺诈率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、召回率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>、精确率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Prec}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Prec</span></span></span></span></span></span>，则入队案件数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_q = \\dfrac{T \\cdot p \\cdot R}{\\mathrm{Prec}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Prec</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，所需在岗人数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3600</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = \\left\\lceil \\dfrac{\\lambda_q \\cdot t_h}{U \\cdot 3600} \\right\\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3600</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为单案平均处理秒数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 为人力利用率）。这里的悖论是：<strong>队列容量固定时，提高召回率的唯一可持续路径是先提高精确率</strong>——把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Prec}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Prec</span></span></span></span></span></span> 从 0.3 提到 0.6，入队量减半，同样人力能处理的真实案件数翻倍。Stripe 的运营版本正是这条原则——把人力集中在「人类判断确实能带来决定性洞察」的支付上（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/radar/reviews\">Stripe Radar 审核文档</a>）。队列之间还必须有<strong>显式降级规则</strong>：Q1 积压超阈值时把 Q2 案件自动降级为「加摩擦 + 继续监控」而非排队等待，且降级必须写进配置并留审计记录。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sla-设计-分诊时限与调查时限的双层预算\">SLA 设计：分诊时限与调查时限的双层预算</h2><p>SLA 常被混淆成单一数字（「48 小时结案」），真正需要分别承诺的是<strong>分诊时限</strong>（MTTA）与<strong>调查时限</strong>（MTTR）。二者失效原因完全不同：MTTA 失效是排班与队列设计问题，MTTR 失效是证据可得性与工具链问题；混成一个数字会让改进方向失焦。</p>\n<p>SLA 上界常由<strong>外部规则</strong>决定。Stripe 明确说明争议答复窗口「通常由卡网络决定，为 7 到 21 天」，期限内未答复则自动败诉、资金无法追回，且<strong>只有一次提交机会</strong>（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/responding\">Stripe 争议答复文档</a>）。更硬的约束来自消费者金融法规：美国 Regulation E §1005.11 规定机构通常须在收到错误通知后 <strong>10 个营业日</strong>内决定是否发生错误；无法完成时可延至 <strong>45 天</strong>，但必须在 10 个营业日内<strong>先行临时入账</strong>（含利息）、确有合理依据时扣留不超过 <strong>50 美元</strong>；新开账户前 30 天内改为 <strong>20 个营业日</strong>，境外发起转账与 POS 借记交易改为 <strong>90 天</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.consumerfinance.gov/rules-policy/regulations/1005/11/\">CFPB Reg E §1005.11</a>）。后果是**「临时入账」与「案件挂起」必须解耦**——资金可先行冲正，调查仍在进行。</p>\n<p>SLA 达成本质是排队论问题。等待超过阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 的概率随利用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\lambda_q / (c\\mu)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 非线性上升：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(W &gt; \\tau) \\approx \\rho^{c} \\cdot e^{-c\\mu(1-\\rho)\\tau}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8588em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。<strong>把利用率推到 95% 的团队，SLA 违约率接近一半</strong>。工程应对不是「让复核员更快」，而是留出 20–30% 容量余量并优先削减入队噪声。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调查工作台-证据聚合-图谱上下文与审计留痕\">调查工作台：证据聚合、图谱上下文与审计留痕</h2><p>复核员的生产力上限由<strong>跨系统切换次数</strong>决定，而非判断力。一个身份欺诈案件需要在支付网关、设备指纹库、图谱库、第三方核验、物流系统之间来回跳转，每跳一次丢失一次上下文。行业方向因此是把证据<strong>拉进一个画布</strong>：Stripe 把风险洞察与「相关支付」并置，并提供 <code>J</code> / <code>K</code> 键在案件间快速移动（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/radar/reviews\">Stripe Radar 审核文档</a>）；Sardine 把交易、对手方、股权结构与间接暴露关系同屏呈现，并把告警、证据、复核员动作与 AI 摘要共同留存（<a href=\"https://www.sardine.ai/risk-case-management\">Sardine Risk Case Management</a>）。</p>\n<p>对合成身份场景，工作台必须连上的证据至少包括：<strong>设备与网络</strong>（指纹、IP 段、代理标记）、<strong>图谱邻域</strong>（所在簇、共享实体、簇的历史结案）、<strong>历史一致性</strong>（注册资料各属性是否自洽）。图谱邻域的读法依赖实体消解质量——同一自然人因共享 IP 被错误合并，会把无辜账号拖进簇并被批量拉黑（见 <a href=\"../identity-graph-resolution/confidence-clustering-collision\">置信度聚类与实体碰撞</a>）。审计留痕是<strong>结案码可信度的前提</strong>：谁在什么时刻做了哪个动作、依据哪几条证据、是否触发双人复核。Sardine 将高风险决策限定为需要双眼复核（two-eyes review），Stripe 要求复核员<strong>只能修改自己的分派、不能改他人的</strong>（同上）——这条权限边界同时防住冒领他人工作量与事后篡改归属两类事故。</p>\n<p>举证材料还有硬性体积约束：Stripe 规定争议举证文件总量不超过 <strong>4.5 MB</strong>、总页数不超过 <strong>50 页</strong>，Mastercard 不超过 <strong>19 页</strong>（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/best-practices\">Stripe 争议举证最佳实践</a>）。这直接约束工作台的导出器：结案时必须<strong>自动裁剪</strong>出与理由码相关的几页。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结案码-质量抽检与反馈回流\">结案码、质量抽检与反馈回流</h2><p>结案不是终点，结案是<strong>标签生产</strong>。复核员写下的每个结案码都是下一轮监督学习的训练样本，因此结案码集合必须封闭、互斥、且与决策动作一一映射。自由文本理由会让统计口径崩塌——每人措辞不同时，「确认欺诈率」无法计算。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结案码</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>触发动作</th>\n<th>回流标签</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>CONFIRMED_FRAUD_SYNTHETIC</code></td>\n<td>确认合成身份</td>\n<td>拉黑簇 + 上报</td>\n<td>强正样本（簇级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CONFIRMED_FRAUD</code></td>\n<td>证据充分，确认欺诈</td>\n<td>拒绝/冻结/上报</td>\n<td>强正样本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CONFIRMED_LEGIT</code></td>\n<td>证据充分，确认正常</td>\n<td>放行 + 白名单</td>\n<td>强负样本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CUSTOMER_ERROR</code></td>\n<td>客户误操作</td>\n<td>引导自助解决</td>\n<td>强负样本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE</code></td>\n<td>情报不足</td>\n<td>挂起 + 监控</td>\n<td>弱标签 / 排除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DUPLICATE</code></td>\n<td>与既有案件重复</td>\n<td>合并到主案</td>\n<td>不进入训练集</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>抽检（QA sampling）是防住「结案码系统性漂移」的唯一手段。漂移的典型形态是复核员在积压压力下把所有难案写成 <code>INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE</code>——表面 SLA 达标，实际把成本推给未来的自己。有效做法是分层抽样：对 <code>INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE</code> 与 <code>CONFIRMED_LEGIT</code> 这类<strong>低成本结案码</strong>施加更高抽样率，因为它们误判动机最强。回流必须<strong>正负等比</strong>：只回灌确认欺诈样本，会让下一轮模型把所有「高分但因证据不足而挂起」的账号当作负样本，判定边界向「少报」漂移。\n运营层还须把<strong>外部约束</strong>纳入结案节奏。Mastercard 的 Excessive Fraud Merchant 计划在电子商务 Mastercard 支付 ≥1,000 笔、净欺诈额 &gt;50,000 美元（澳大利亚 15,000 美元）、欺诈拒付率 &gt;0.50% 且 3DS 占比低于 10%（受监管国家 50%）时触发，罚金从第 2 个月的 500 美元逐级升至 100,000 美元；Visa 的 Acquirer Monitoring Program 以拒付与欺诈比率（不达标 0.5%、超标 1.5%，CEMEA 2.2%）判定（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/monitoring-programs\">Stripe 监测计划文档</a>）。即<strong>结案慢会推高拒付率，拒付率超标会触发卡组织罚金乃至收单资格风险</strong>。2026 年 10 月起 Visa 在亚太区启用 MERP，把监测节点前移到早期账户（同上）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分诊与案件管理是两个问题：前者是受限资源下的排序，后者是带留痕的状态机；行业平台把二者合并为同一对象（Stripe Review 的 <code>review.opened</code>/<code>review.closed</code>、Sardine 的集中案件视图）。</li>\n<li>队列分级依据是<strong>错误延迟的代价</strong>（变现窗口 24–72 小时、金额量级、下游影响），不是分数高低；高优先级队列必须留 15–30% 容量余量。</li>\n<li>SLA 必须拆成 MTTA 与 MTTR 两层；上界常由外部规则决定——争议答复 7–21 天且只有一次机会，Reg E 的 10/45 营业日与临时入账、50 美元扣留、20/90 天延长条款。</li>\n<li>工作台的价值在于减少跨系统切换；对合成身份场景必须并置设备、图谱邻域与历史一致性三类证据，并保留不可篡改的审计时间线。</li>\n<li>结案码是标签生产，必须封闭、互斥、与动作一一映射；QA 对低成本结案码提高抽样率，回流保持正负等比；运营节奏受卡组织监测计划反向约束（Mastercard EFM/ECP 罚金阶梯、Visa VAMP 阈值、2026 年 10 月亚太 MERP）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"告警分诊与案件管理：队列分级、SLA 与调查工作台","id":"告警分诊与案件管理-队列分级-sla-与调查工作台"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从告警洪流到可结案案件","id":"核心概念-从告警洪流到可结案案件"},{"level":2,"text":"队列分级：按代价与时效切分工作池","id":"队列分级-按代价与时效切分工作池"},{"level":2,"text":"SLA 设计：分诊时限与调查时限的双层预算","id":"sla-设计-分诊时限与调查时限的双层预算"},{"level":2,"text":"调查工作台：证据聚合、图谱上下文与审计留痕","id":"调查工作台-证据聚合-图谱上下文与审计留痕"},{"level":2,"text":"结案码、质量抽检与反馈回流","id":"结案码-质量抽检与反馈回流"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"模型评估与对抗漂移：标签稀缺、precision@k 与 evasion 防范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/synthetic-identity-fraud-graph-detection/graph-fraud-detection-ml/model-evaluation-adversarial"},"next":{"title":"对抗性行动与申诉救济：拒绝/封禁决策的通知与误杀挽回","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/synthetic-identity-fraud-graph-detection/investigation-ops-compliance/adverse-action-appeal"}}